## 1. Open the admin

Follow the local setup instructions in the README and select a collection.

## 2. Edit the content

Create a separate entry for each language. Use the same translation group and different permanent identifiers. Set a publication date before publishing.

## 3. Build

```sh
npm run build
npm run preview
```

This guide is sample content for trying the initial setup.

